title: "BPM-ESG-Metrics-SLR: replication package and dataset"

type: dataset

authors:
  - family-names: "Costa"
    given-names: "Simone da Silva"
  - family-names: "Thom"
    given-names: "Lucineia Heloisa"

version: "1.0"

date-released: "2026-11-15"

abstract: >
  Replication package associated with a systematic literature review on
  business process adherence to ESG, sustainability, and regulatory
  requirements. The repository contains the final corpus of 110 studies,
  extraction and coding data, database-specific search strategies,
  and supporting materials.

keywords:
  - BPM
  - ESG
  - systematic literature review
  - business process
  - sustainability
  - process compliance
  - metrics
